{"tool_name":"findfoci","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>The FindFoci plugins allow the identification of peak intensity regions within 2D and 3D images. The algorithm is highly configurable and parameters can be optimised using reference images and then applied to multiple images using the batch mode. Details of the benefits of training an algorithm on multiple images can be found in the FindFoci paper: 2591</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>The FindFoci plugins allow the identification of peak intensity regions within 2D and 3D images. The algorithm is highly configurable and parameters can be optimised using reference images and then applied to multiple images using the batch mode. Details of the benefits of training an algorithm on multiple images can be found in the FindFoci paper: 2591</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2019-10-28T11:19:42+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2014-12-19T12:42:13+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1505209960,"last_comment_uid":164,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Alex Herbert"}],"has_biological_terms":[{"target_id":4993,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"662cd4ca-3dfa-4937-acf9-1341e7eab182","url":"/taxonomy/term/4993"}],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[{"options":[],"title":"pdf","uri":"http://www.sussex.ac.uk/gdsc/intranet/pdfs/FindFoci.pdf"}],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[{"target_id":42,"target_type":"user","target_uuid":"a924b827-fe88-49fb-80d9-9d19042c7aec","url":"/user/42"}],"has_function":[{"target_id":4035,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation_Spot_extraction","url":"/spot-detection-0"}],"has_implementation":[{"target_id":4340,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid